The function $F$ in Problem \eqref{prob:minfg} is called ProxPL, if there exists $\mu > 0$, called the ProxPL constant, such that 
\begin{equation}
\cD_g(x,L)
~\geq~
2 \mu \big( F(x) - F^* \big)  \qquad  \forall x,
\tag{ProxPL}
\label{def:ProxPL}
\end{equation}

